Package: mkscript
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Create Bash, Docker, Kubernetes, Terraform, and Ansible starter files safely
 mkscript creates executable Bash script files with a standard
 #!/usr/bin/env bash shebang, plus Dockerfile, Docker Compose,
 Kubernetes, Terraform, and Ansible starter files.
 .
 It refuses to overwrite existing files, symlinks, and directories,
 can optionally add set -euo pipefail via -s or --strict, can create
 shortcuts for new or existing local scripts, and can check or remove
 those shortcuts later.
